WEBVTT

00:00:05.557 --> 00:00:06.991
(chuckles)

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:08.525
- (grunts)
- (yelps)

00:00:08.626 --> 00:00:11.528
- (whistle blowing repeatedly)
- Huh?

00:00:12.296 --> 00:00:14.531
- What the...
- (grunts "I don't know")

00:00:17.869 --> 00:00:19.503
(whistles loudly)

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:23.140
Okay. Let's do this.

00:00:24.809 --> 00:00:27.210
(whistles loudly)

00:00:27.311 --> 00:00:29.581
Huh? You've got to be kidding.

00:00:29.681 --> 00:00:31.481
(whistles loudly)

00:00:31.583 --> 00:00:33.483
Okay, okay.

00:00:33.585 --> 00:00:35.085
Better?

00:00:35.853 --> 00:00:37.421
(blows whistle)

00:00:38.455 --> 00:00:39.824
(grunts)

00:00:39.924 --> 00:00:41.893
- PERRY: What?
- GRU: Hmm?

00:00:41.993 --> 00:00:43.093
(grunts)

00:00:43.193 --> 00:00:44.562
PERRY:
That doesn't count.

00:00:44.662 --> 00:00:46.330
- And... oh! What?
- (blowing whistle repeatedly)

00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:48.933
You can't just... (grunts)

00:00:49.033 --> 00:00:50.367
This is ridiculous!

00:00:50.467 --> 00:00:53.303
- (whistles loudly)
- Huh? (grunts)

00:00:54.005 --> 00:00:56.239
(Ron grunting)

00:00:56.340 --> 00:00:58.610
Ah. (speaks Minionese)

00:00:59.309 --> 00:01:01.546
- (explosive bang)
- (Ron screams)

00:01:04.048 --> 00:01:05.817
- (groaning)
- (gasps)

00:01:05.917 --> 00:01:07.517
(chuckles) Thanks, Ron.

00:01:07.619 --> 00:01:08.753
Hey, no! Oh, no!

00:01:08.853 --> 00:01:10.021
(muffled shouting)

00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:11.154
- (chattering wildly)
- (girls laughing)

00:01:11.254 --> 00:01:12.991
EDITH:
Come and get it.

00:01:13.091 --> 00:01:15.158
- Oh, it's so cute.
- Whoa.

00:01:15.258 --> 00:01:17.662
This is the weirdest dog ever.

00:01:17.762 --> 00:01:18.930
(doorbell rings)

00:01:19.030 --> 00:01:20.865
I'll get it.

00:01:20.965 --> 00:01:23.400
♪

00:01:27.972 --> 00:01:29.239
(gasps)

00:01:29.339 --> 00:01:31.843
Well, hello, little one.

00:01:31.943 --> 00:01:33.611
Is your daddy home?

00:01:33.711 --> 00:01:37.447
Sorry. I'm not "stupposed"
to talk to strangers.

00:01:37.548 --> 00:01:40.283
(chuckles):
Oh. I'm not a stranger.

00:01:40.384 --> 00:01:43.520
Well, you look strange to me.

00:01:43.621 --> 00:01:44.254
(groans)

00:01:44.354 --> 00:01:45.823
MARGO:
Who is it?

00:01:45.923 --> 00:01:47.457
I don't know.

00:01:47.558 --> 00:01:51.729
But she's old
and smells like pickles.

00:01:51.829 --> 00:01:52.797
(panting)

00:01:52.897 --> 00:01:53.965
(sniffs)

00:01:54.065 --> 00:01:55.198
(whimpering)

00:01:55.298 --> 00:01:57.568
Okay, I'm coming.

00:01:59.137 --> 00:02:00.872
(Poppy gasps)

00:02:00.972 --> 00:02:02.172
Oh, no. Um...

00:02:02.272 --> 00:02:04.609
- I'll be right back.
- (whimpering)

00:02:04.709 --> 00:02:06.077
(Gru Jr. babbling)

00:02:06.176 --> 00:02:08.012
Can I help you?

00:02:08.112 --> 00:02:09.881
Well, I hope so.

00:02:09.981 --> 00:02:12.382
I'm an old friend of Gru's.

00:02:13.017 --> 00:02:15.285
Well, he's not here, so...

00:02:15.385 --> 00:02:17.855
Oh, that's all right.

00:02:17.955 --> 00:02:18.856
(girls yelp)

00:02:18.956 --> 00:02:20.457
I'll wait.

00:02:21.191 --> 00:02:22.593
(exhausted panting)

00:02:22.694 --> 00:02:23.661
(whistle blows)

00:02:23.761 --> 00:02:25.029
Huh? What? No!

00:02:25.129 --> 00:02:26.463
- (whistles loudly)
- (yells, groans)

00:02:26.564 --> 00:02:28.933
Whenever you're ready, Perry.

00:02:29.033 --> 00:02:30.968
- (cell phone chimes)
- Um...

00:02:31.069 --> 00:02:32.536
Hmm?

00:02:34.906 --> 00:02:35.973
(gasps)

00:02:36.074 --> 00:02:38.943
(quiet chatter, laughter)

00:02:39.043 --> 00:02:42.180
Needless to say, Perry and I
are no longer welcome

00:02:42.279 --> 00:02:44.048
on the island of O'ahu.

00:02:44.148 --> 00:02:46.184
(laughs)
True story.

00:02:46.283 --> 00:02:48.186
- (chuckles)
- GRU: Honey.

00:02:48.285 --> 00:02:49.654
- Oh, thank goodness.
- It's the children.

00:02:49.754 --> 00:02:52.322
- We have to go now.
- (gasps, gulps)

00:02:52.957 --> 00:02:54.025
Oh.

00:02:54.125 --> 00:02:55.525
Thanks. Bye.

00:02:55.626 --> 00:02:57.394
- Our cover's blown.
- What?

00:02:57.494 --> 00:02:59.296
- Call Silas.
- Oh, no.

00:02:59.396 --> 00:03:01.599
(blowing whistle repeatedly)

00:03:02.299 --> 00:03:04.234
(line ringing)

00:03:05.103 --> 00:03:07.437
(beeping)

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:11.209
(chatter in Minionese)

00:03:11.308 --> 00:03:13.310
- (yelling)
- (laughing)

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:15.646
(Minionese chatter continues)

00:03:20.918 --> 00:03:22.352
(shouting in Minionese)

00:03:22.452 --> 00:03:24.188
(laughter, whooping)

00:03:24.287 --> 00:03:25.489
(frantic gasping)

00:03:25.590 --> 00:03:27.524
♪ Happy birthday to you.

00:03:27.625 --> 00:03:29.794
(Minionese chatter continues)

00:03:29.894 --> 00:03:31.796
(spits, groans)

00:03:31.896 --> 00:03:33.164
(chuckles)

00:03:33.263 --> 00:03:34.364
Ah. (clears throat)

00:03:34.464 --> 00:03:35.833
- (alarm blaring)
- (gasps)

00:03:35.933 --> 00:03:37.400
Gru's been compromised.

00:03:37.501 --> 00:03:39.269
This is an emergency, people.

00:03:39.369 --> 00:03:41.505
Retirement is officially over.

00:03:41.606 --> 00:03:44.474
Assemble the Mega Minions.

00:03:48.946 --> 00:03:50.681
(seagulls squawking)

00:03:51.348 --> 00:03:52.850
(rapid beeping)

00:03:52.950 --> 00:03:54.552
(gasps)
Pomodoro!

00:03:54.652 --> 00:03:57.255
- (laughs)
- (seagulls screeching)

00:03:57.354 --> 00:03:59.690
(munching loudly)

00:04:00.958 --> 00:04:02.560
- (rapid beeping)
- (gasps)

00:04:02.660 --> 00:04:04.095
Pomodoro!

00:04:04.195 --> 00:04:06.631
(laughing)

00:04:08.032 --> 00:04:10.134
(laughs)

00:04:10.234 --> 00:04:12.570
Shooshta, shooshta,
shooshta, shooshta,

00:04:12.670 --> 00:04:15.039
shooshta, shooshta, shooshta!

00:04:15.139 --> 00:04:16.808
(bees buzzing)

00:04:16.908 --> 00:04:18.843
Hey. (chuckles)

00:04:18.943 --> 00:04:20.845
Bello, busy bee.

00:04:20.945 --> 00:04:22.580
(gasps) Aw.

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:24.715
- (rapid beeping)
- (gasps, laughs)

00:04:24.816 --> 00:04:26.083
Pomodoro!

00:04:26.184 --> 00:04:28.553
(laughs)

00:04:28.653 --> 00:04:29.452
(bellows)

00:04:29.554 --> 00:04:31.923
- Yee-haw!
- (rapid beeping)

00:04:32.023 --> 00:04:33.090
(gasping excitedly)

00:04:33.191 --> 00:04:34.725
Pomodoro!

00:04:35.827 --> 00:04:36.961
(chuckles)

00:04:37.061 --> 00:04:38.162
Pomodoro!

00:04:38.262 --> 00:04:39.864
- Yee-haw!
- (bellowing)

00:04:39.964 --> 00:04:41.866
Yippa, yippa!

00:04:43.935 --> 00:04:45.169
Huh?

00:04:45.269 --> 00:04:46.871
Whoa. (laughs)

00:04:46.971 --> 00:04:48.072
Yeah!

00:04:48.172 --> 00:04:49.273
- (laughs)
- (rapid beeping)

00:04:49.372 --> 00:04:50.875
Huh? (groans)

00:04:50.975 --> 00:04:52.777
(grumbling)

00:04:57.682 --> 00:05:01.953
So, your father
has been naughty.

00:05:02.053 --> 00:05:04.454
Very naughty.

00:05:05.590 --> 00:05:08.292
He took something of mine
that I desperately want back.

00:05:08.425 --> 00:05:09.727
(all gasp)

00:05:09.827 --> 00:05:10.460
(yells)

00:05:10.561 --> 00:05:13.064
(both grunting fiercely)

00:05:13.164 --> 00:05:15.166
Principal Übelschlecht?

00:05:15.800 --> 00:05:19.070
Ooh. I know you took my Lenny.

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:20.938
- Now, hand him over!
- Ow!

00:05:21.038 --> 00:05:22.240
Ow. That... (chuckles)

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:24.542
- Actually very funny story.
- Zip it!

00:05:24.642 --> 00:05:26.177
I don't want to hear
your excuses.

00:05:26.277 --> 00:05:27.410
I'm here to teach you a lesson.

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:29.013
Let's go, tough guy.

00:05:29.113 --> 00:05:30.281
(chuckling):
Okay.

00:05:30.380 --> 00:05:32.250
I'm not going to fight
an old lady.

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:33.516
Oh, yeah?

00:05:33.618 --> 00:05:35.152
Well, I'm gonna give you
a whupping

00:05:35.253 --> 00:05:36.787
for the history books.

00:05:36.888 --> 00:05:38.322
Whoa, whoa!

00:05:38.421 --> 00:05:40.925
- (grunts)
- (Lucy gasps, yelps)

00:05:41.025 --> 00:05:42.459
Take that!

00:05:42.560 --> 00:05:44.328
- (Gru grunts, groans)
- (Lucy gasps)

00:05:44.427 --> 00:05:46.230
(whimpers)

00:05:46.330 --> 00:05:48.366
- Yeah, go!
- (Gru yelps)

00:05:48.465 --> 00:05:50.533
Girls, look out! Over here!

00:05:50.635 --> 00:05:52.270
- Everyone, get down!
- GIRLS: Gru!

00:05:52.370 --> 00:05:53.503
(girls and Minions whimpering)

00:05:53.604 --> 00:05:56.207
Hey, back off, lady.

00:05:56.307 --> 00:05:58.576
(grunting)

00:05:59.844 --> 00:06:01.812
♪

00:06:05.316 --> 00:06:07.218
(Gru yelling)

00:06:07.318 --> 00:06:08.819
Stop it!

00:06:08.920 --> 00:06:09.820
Let him go!

00:06:09.921 --> 00:06:11.923
- Take that!
- (Minions yelling)

00:06:12.023 --> 00:06:13.958
(babbling happily)

00:06:14.058 --> 00:06:15.492
(laughing)

00:06:15.593 --> 00:06:17.995
(grunting and groaning)

00:06:18.095 --> 00:06:19.330
(continues laughing)

00:06:19.429 --> 00:06:21.399
(chuckles)
Now we have to get in there

00:06:21.498 --> 00:06:22.667
and find that baby.

00:06:22.767 --> 00:06:24.368
- (clattering)
- What?

00:06:24.467 --> 00:06:26.938
(laughing)

00:06:27.038 --> 00:06:28.105
(gasps)

00:06:28.205 --> 00:06:29.373
Oh! Jackpot, huh?

00:06:29.472 --> 00:06:30.574
Ay, Maxime.

00:06:30.675 --> 00:06:32.442
- This is too easy.
- (both laugh)

00:06:32.543 --> 00:06:35.246
MAXIME:
Come here, little baby.

00:06:35.346 --> 00:06:36.547
Come to Maxime.

00:06:36.647 --> 00:06:38.683
Yes. Coochie-coochie...

00:06:38.783 --> 00:06:40.618
- (screams) Oh!
- (yelps) Ay, Maxime.

00:06:40.718 --> 00:06:42.420
- You little...
- (Gru Jr. fusses)

00:06:42.519 --> 00:06:44.989
You are in big trouble.

00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:47.658
- Gotcha!
- (yelps)

00:06:47.758 --> 00:06:49.627
(grunting and groaning continue)

00:06:49.727 --> 00:06:52.163
- (electrical crackling)
- (pained whimpering)

00:06:52.263 --> 00:06:54.065
(panicked grunting)

00:06:54.165 --> 00:06:55.933
(screaming)

00:06:57.268 --> 00:06:58.636
- Whew.
- (all panting)

00:06:58.736 --> 00:07:00.404
Wait. Where's the baby?

00:07:00.503 --> 00:07:02.807
- Where's the baby?!
- (gasps)

00:07:02.907 --> 00:07:04.075
Junior?

00:07:04.175 --> 00:07:06.509
(Gru Jr. crying)

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:08.145
- (Übelschlecht yells)
- (Lucy gasps)

00:07:08.245 --> 00:07:09.246
GRU:
Lucy!

00:07:09.347 --> 00:07:10.381
Go after the baby.

00:07:10.480 --> 00:07:11.983
(gasps)

00:07:12.083 --> 00:07:13.150
(aircraft whirring)

00:07:13.250 --> 00:07:14.352
Maxime.

00:07:14.452 --> 00:07:16.320
Say <i>au revoir,</i> Gru.

00:07:16.420 --> 00:07:17.655
Oh, and don't worry.

00:07:17.755 --> 00:07:20.458
He will be very happy
with his new daddy.

00:07:20.558 --> 00:07:21.792
Right? Look at him.

00:07:21.892 --> 00:07:24.261
- Oh, he loves his new daddy.
- (crying)

00:07:24.362 --> 00:07:26.030
Junior!

00:07:26.130 --> 00:07:27.932
(crying continues)

00:07:28.032 --> 00:07:29.834
No!

